<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>TRAPPIN' IN JAPAN!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">22december, V.I.N</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">TRAPPIN' IN JAPAN!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">22HLziTrKI6ZEjoBpD5w1K</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.100" end="00:13.530">Trappin' in Japan, I got a Glocky in my waistband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.530" end="00:16.600">Twelve, they tryna catch me, I said "Fuck the law" and then I ran</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.600" end="00:19.220">Smokin' on a blunt, while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.220" end="00:22.130">If you gettin' on my nerves, put you in a body bag, bitch I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.130" end="00:24.940">Trappin' in Japan, I got a Glocky in my waistband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.940" end="00:27.540">Twelve, they tryna catch me, I said "Fuck the law" and then I ran</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.540" end="00:30.010">Smokin' on a blunt, while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.010" end="00:33.170">If you gettin' on my nerves, put you in a body bag, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.170" end="00:35.780">Put 'em in the bag, pack it up, it's in the mall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.780" end="00:38.460">If you jokers think its funny but come hear her while she walk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.460" end="00:41.090">I'm never claiming the goopy, 'cause y'all be tryna talk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.090" end="00:43.970">Never see how I move you, 'cause I'm a ninja how I stalk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.970" end="00:46.850">I'm loading up the clip, I got my Glocky packin' six small</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.850" end="00:49.480">Pull up in a whip, I'm gonna have to let it rip on ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.480" end="00:52.240">Never catch you, lady, I'm not rockin' with ya mans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.240" end="00:55.120">But we drifitin' through the lane and we trappin' in Japan, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.120" end="00:56.620">So great, you'll drift for the beat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.420" end="00:58.080">I, cut through my opps like a leaf</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.080" end="00:59.580">Like, countin' up my racks in a C5</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.470" end="01:00.970">Opps in the back and they revive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.940" end="01:02.440">Go switch my mind with the beat now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.160" end="01:03.660">'Cause I'm the king they see now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.550" end="01:05.050">I'm move these kids with the beam now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.950" end="01:06.450">I'm at the top, look at me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.400" end="01:07.900">I don't like Jeep with the back out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.760" end="01:09.260">Roll with my clique got my stacks up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.010" end="01:10.510">I hit my walk when the act up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.370" end="01:11.870">You sensing me, get packed up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.630" end="01:13.380">Up in the night, get clapped up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.380" end="01:14.880">It's me verse you, bad matchup</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.610" end="01:16.110">One left, one right, get jabbed up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.840" end="01:17.340">My moves, they speed like Jaguar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.120" end="01:20.010">Trappin' in Japan, I got a Glocky in my waistband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.010" end="01:22.760">Twelve, they tryna catch me, I said "Fuck the law" and then I ran</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.760" end="01:25.260">Smokin' on a blunt, while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.260" end="01:28.150">If you gettin' on my nerves, put you in a body bag, bitch I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.150" end="01:31.010">Trappin' in Japan, I got a Glocky in my waistband</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.010" end="01:33.870">Twelve, they tryna catch me, I said "Fuck the law" and then I ran</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.870" end="01:36.320">Smokin' on a blunt, while I'm countin' all my cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.320" end="01:38.850">If you gettin' on my nerves, put you in a body bag, bitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.850" end="01:42.850" /></div></body></tt>